# Lokatif — environment variables
#
# Copy to `.env.local` and fill in real values. Never commit real secrets.

# --- Server-only secrets (NEVER prefix with VITE_) --------------------------
# The Google Gemini API key. Used ONLY by the Vercel Edge Function
# (api/gemini.ts) via process.env. It must never be exposed to the browser,
# so it must NOT use the VITE_ prefix (VITE_-prefixed vars are inlined into
# the public client bundle by Vite).
#
# Set this in the Vercel project settings (Environment Variables) for
# production, and in `.env.local` for local dev.
GEMINI_API_KEY=your-google-gemini-api-key

# NOTE: There is intentionally no VITE_GEMINI_API_KEY. All Gemini traffic is
# routed through the /api/gemini proxy, which injects the key server-side.
